<th id="S5.T3.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T3.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PQ (ratio of SAQ)</span></th>
